  (text "Normally-closed external cut loop and voltage-supervisor output clear the D flip-flop.\nThe controller must send a new MOTOR_ARM clock edge after the loop is closed and the supply is good.\nThis is an electrical motor-power cut, not a validated stop/pose strategy."
